From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 15:37:54 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Record GPU memory snapshots and rate-limit micromap budget
 logs

Share the device-local VRAM collector with GetVramStats, capture all driver
heaps at cuts, five-minute intervals and device loss, and atomically keep
a best-effort schema-1 crash marker before Sentry and termination.
Keep independent micromap warning counts for the device lifetime.

Add CPU-only timing, serialization and failed-write tests. Guard optional
fork test targets whose ignored sources are absent from the recorded tree
so a clean, verified build needs no unrecorded source files.

Co-Authored-By: Codex (gpt-6.1-sol) <noreply@openai.com>
